          "text": "Nothing.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "deep_ilde_shaft_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "She puts the scriber down. “It goes up further than there is rock above it.” She lets you have that. “I sectioned it. I took the depth from the surface and I took the height of the shaft and the second is bigger. I wrote the number down and then I scratched it out, because a number like that gets a surveyor retired.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "deep_vault_shaft"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "deep_ilde_shaft_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "deep_ilde_shaft_wont",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I've said all I mean to,” they say, and go back to what they were doing."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_wayfinders",
            "amount": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "deep_ilde_shaft_drop",
          "text": "Leave it.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "deep_ilde_warm_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“Warm and salt.” She is precise. “There is no sea within four hundred miles of straight down from that hall. I have tasted it and I have had it tasted by somebody who did not know where it came from, and they said seawater.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "deep_vault_warm"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "deep_ilde_warm_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "deep_ilde_warm_wont",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I've said all I mean to,” they say, and go back to what they were doing."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_wayfinders",
            "amount": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "deep_ilde_warm_drop",
          "text": "Leave it.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "deep_ilde_spacing_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“Twice what you would light a road at, and exact between one and the next.” She does not have to check. “I took it as a young surveyor because it looked wrong. It is wrong, and it is *consistent*, which is worse. A lamp interval drifts. That does not.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "deep_lamps_spacing"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "deep_ilde_spacing_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "deep_ilde_spacing_wont",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I've said all I mean to,” they say, and go back to what they were doing."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_wayfinders",
            "amount": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "deep_ilde_spacing_drop",
          "text": "Leave it.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "deep_ilde_plate_gave",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "She fetches it and turns it so the scratched-out corner is toward you first, which is either honesty or relief. “Eight pillars on it,” she says. “Go and count them, and then come back and tell me I sectioned it wrong.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "grantItem": {
            "target": {
              "ref": "actor.id"
            },
            "item": "survey_plate",
            "quantity": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "setFlag": {
            "flag": "given:survey_plate",
            "value": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "deep_ilde_plate_thanks",
          "text": "Thank you.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "deep_ilde_plate_kept",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“It is scribed for the guild,” she says, and does not look at the corner. “Ask me the measurements.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_wayfinders",
            "amount": -2
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "deep_ilde_plate_leave",
          "text": "Then no.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    }
